{
  "uid": "concert-ops-traces",
  "title": "Traces",
  "tags": ["concert-ops", "traces"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["5s", "10s", "30s", "1m", "5m"],
    "time_options": ["5m", "15m", "30m", "1h", "3h", "6h", "12h", "24h", "2d", "7d"]
  },
  "links": [
    { "type": "dashboards", "tags": ["concert-ops"], "asDropdown": true, "includeVars": true, "keepTime": true, "title": "Dashboards" }
  ],
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": { "type": "grafana", "uid": "-- Grafana --" },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "orange",
        "name": "Load tests",
        "target": { "limit": 100, "matchAny": false, "tags": ["load-test"], "type": "tags" },
        "type": "tags"
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(http_requests_total, service)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Recent traces",
      "description": "Click a trace ID in Explore to open the waterfall",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "inspect": false }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Duration", "desc": true }]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Traces with errors",
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" }, "inspect": false }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name =~ \"$service\" && status = error }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read traces",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Traces\n\n- **Recent traces** lists traces for the selected services.\n- **Traces with errors** uses TraceQL `status = error`.\n- For the waterfall, open **Explore → Tempo**, paste a trace ID, or search with `{resource.service.name=\"ticketing\"}`.\n- Tempo also has a direct API: `http://localhost:3200/api/search` and `http://localhost:3200/api/traces/<traceID>`.\n- Only HTTP requests are traced; the hold sweeper creates short separate traces."
      }
    }
  ]
}
